{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026CCiHGcL0KC1794614930.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國際能源署(IEA)表示，今年全球石油需求跌幅較早前預期更大。</p><p></p><p>預計全年石油需求平均減少每日270萬桶，至1.02億。國際能源署上月曾預期，平均減少每日260萬桶。此外，自美國放寬俄羅斯石油制裁後，俄羅斯10月原油產量升至每日873萬桶，較9月增加每日21萬桶。而海灣地區出口回升，令到全球石油市場自中東衝突爆發以來，首次轉為供過於求。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:57:08.155770+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T23:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T06:34:12.474048+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T00:50:23.123807+00:00","content_hash":"0992d8e3851372e411f22727ebf24b7d38a7fe23d33a33d89b3421c5886ed31f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:57:08.155770+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}